  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.164` to `4.1.165`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.164...application_builder_helpers/4.1.165)\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(config): count `@ref`: hops against the 32-hop cap (Fixes #725) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/728\n* fix(cli): run command dependency entries last so commands override shared-module defaults (Fixes #727) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/729\n* docs: correct steps 5–8 joint-run order docs (#726 DOCS-NOTE) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/730\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20261016103222.aff97d2...build.20261017183540.d6fc728",
